	OVERALL_SATISFACTION_CLEANLINESS_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Overall Satisfaction Cleanliness Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5.',
	OVERALL_SATISFACTION_ACCURACY_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Overall Satisfaction Accuracy Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5.',
	OVERALL_SATISFACTION_FOOD_TASTE_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Overall Satisfacton Food Taste Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5.',
	OVERALL_SATISFACTION_FRIENDLINESS_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Overall Satisfaction Friendliness Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5.',
	OVERALL_SATISFACTION_SERVICE_SPEED_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Overall Satisfaction Service Speed Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5.',
	CUST_RETURN_LIKELY_SCORE_NBR COMMENT 'Customer Return Likely Score Number. Valid values 1 through 5. ',
	CUST_LIKE_CONTACT_IND COMMENT 'Customer Like Contact Indicator specifies that the customer would like to be folowed up with.',
