	SOURCE_SURVEY_SUB_CHANNEL_CD COMMENT 'Source Survey Sub Channel further refines the source of the survey channell and is the value that come with the survey response. Sample Values Email Invite, Email Invite - ecommerce, Receipt, and QR Code.',
